{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find, grasp and process object. If object visible, then approach and grab it. Move and process. Scan if unsuccessful.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GraspObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToProcessingStation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject>     <Sequence>         <Action ID = InspectObject    />         <Condition ID = IsObjectValid    />         <Action ID = AnalyzeObject    />         <Condition ID = IsProcessingComplete    />     </Sequence> </Action>",
